# Tuning corpus for IDX/opt.pl -- one wav path per line, '#' comments ignored.
#
# The nz_wins set (9 real MS-ADPCM music files, 0.7-3.4 MB each) is a good
# target: full-length, varied material, and with a published nz -cc column to
# check against.  It is single-encoder and MS-only, though, so freeze the IMA-
# relevant parameters with the '!' line modifier before tuning on it alone.
#
#music_00002.wav
#music_00003.wav
#music_00004.wav
